From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 18:53:41 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: remove client-side telemetry uploader

Deletes crates/client/src/telemetry.rs (the client::Telemetry event/
minidump uploader) and its event_coalescer submodule, the telemetry
log-viewer (crates/zed/src/zed/telemetry_log.rs + toolbar item + View
menu entry), and the main.rs telemetry startup (system_id/installation_id
machinery, telemetry.start, flush_events). The macro-based producers were
removed in 0001, but the client.telemetry().report_*/log_edit_event path
survived; this removes it so reintroduction fails to compile.

os_name()/os_version() (consumed by the kept system_specs feature) are
relocated into the system_specs crate. TelemetrySettings + its onboarding
toggles are removed; the TelemetrySettingsContent serde schema is left as
inert (deferred). Cloud request-builders in client.rs/user.rs that read
telemetry system_id now pass None (those requests are removed in a later
patch). AgentTelemetry (NativeAgentConnection) is a separate subsystem and
is untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
